  "details": "Currently the VRChat keyboard you type a character when you release the trigger, as opposed to when you press down the trigger immediately.\nThis is very frustrating because almost every other single keyboard in VR apps and games have it set so it types when you press down the trigger immediately, which makes the VRChat one feel unresponsive, slow and generally much more difficult to type on because it's very easy to miss a single letter because you went little too fast.",
